# Notebook Conventions

- Run cells top-to-bottom; imports and env loading come first.
- Reuse course helpers: `fetch_website_contents`, `load_dotenv`, `OpenAI()`.
- Default models in course: `gpt-4.1-mini`, `gpt-4.1-nano`, `gpt-5-nano`.
- Use `display(Markdown(...))` for rendered LLM output.
- Clear outputs before git commit unless the user asks to keep them.
- Exercise notebooks belong in `community-contributions/slavapa/`, not in core `day*.ipynb` files.
